  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLIMB:Child Labor Improvements in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will build the capacity of civil society to more effectively detect and combat forced child labor and other labor abuses in the dried fish sector in Bangladesh. It will leverage partnerships with academic and community based organizations to build a grassroots movement, empower vulnerable families, connect survivors to services and reduce the risk that children will be forced into this harmful work.</narrative>
  </description>
